#: ../../source/quickstart.md:1 084fd73774f64065a11753617350dd8e
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:3 c89a7afd6bd841ec8cc8efd827d0571e
msgid "这页只做一件事：从安装到生成第一批候选结构。跑通以后，再去看完整清洗流程和每张卡片的参数。"
msgstr ""
"This page takes you from installation to a first set of candidate "
"structures. Once that path works, continue with the full cleaning "
"workflow and the parameter reference for individual cards."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:5 5c59a937546340d1b60ea02f6b12798a
msgid "1. 安装"
msgstr "Step 1: Install NepTrainKit"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:7 ab7b2829ad7e41fa89b2be5c867b7fdd
msgid "建议使用独立环境，Python 版本用 3.10 到 3.12。"
msgstr "Use an isolated environment with Python 3.10 through 3.12."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:9 2c720e645df04729a3eb4122b608d58f
msgid ""
"conda create -n nepkit python=3.10\n"
"conda activate nepkit\n"
"pip install NepTrainKit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:15 e11f1cda3ce744ff9c345e27ddcc1fb0
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 会安装独立的 `nep-adapters` 运行时。macOS 和 Windows wheel 提供 CPU；Linux "
"x86_64 wheel 同时提供 CPU 和 CUDA。安装 wheel 不要求本机安装 CUDA Toolkit 或 NVCC，但 CUDA "
"计算需要兼容的 NVIDIA 驱动。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit installs the separate `nep-adapters` runtime. The macOS and "
"Windows wheels provide CPU support, while the Linux x86_64 wheel provides "
"both CPU and CUDA. Installing a wheel does not require a local CUDA Toolkit "
"or NVCC, but CUDA calculations require a compatible NVIDIA driver."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:17 5fc4f671e08b4e1a947f8fe591ee5653
msgid "安装后先确认运行时状态："
msgstr "Confirm the runtime status after installation:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:19 3c1967a41b7a4c3689eaf0b68703e4ac
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:23 c12d4ce5994c44a39c50b7b25d447117
msgid ""
"如果 `cuda` 显示不可用，NepTrainKit 的 `Auto` 模式会说明原因并使用 CPU。只有在必须使用 CUDA 时才明确选择 "
"`CUDA`；不可用时程序会直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"If `cuda` is unavailable, NepTrainKit's `Auto` mode explains why and uses "
"the CPU. Select `CUDA` explicitly only when CUDA is required; the application "
"will report an error if it is unavailable."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:25 7d64d0ddbec641c98740476d4e263ab7
msgid "启动软件："
msgstr "Launch the application:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:27 5f056dc03d014cd48e86a5de41c7a877
msgid "nepkit\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:31 87fa1e7b0a1e4d2d8b4436fd04522c9e
msgid "2. 打开 Make Dataset"
msgstr "Step 2: Open Make Dataset"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:33 46d7269f7b5840cdac3afa0f13fe7ce4
msgid ""
"第一次建议从 `Make Dataset` 开始。它的职责是制作训练集候选结构：输入一批基础结构， "
"选择一张或多张卡片，生成应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性构型。"
msgstr ""
"Start with `Make Dataset` when learning the application. It turns a set "
"of base structures into candidate configurations through one or more "
"cards, including strain, perturbation, defects, surfaces, doping, and "
"magnetic configurations."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:36 d10e4b3329ae419baa5a2748601467eb
msgid ""
"切到 `Make Dataset` 后，先点击窗口顶部的 `Open` 按钮导入初始结构。这里的初始结构 通常是已经弛豫好的 "
"`xyz`、`extxyz`、`POSCAR` 或 `CIF` 文件；后面的卡片都会以这批结构 作为输入继续生成候选构型。"
msgstr ""
"Switch to `Make Dataset`, then click `Open` in the title bar and import "
"the starting structures. These are normally relaxed `xyz`, `extxyz`, "
"`POSCAR`, or `CIF` files. Every card added later uses this collection as "
"its input."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:40 61954afaf02b4c9a9ea2ac0c80e4d75a
msgid "Make Dataset empty workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:40 61954afaf02b4c9a9ea2ac0c80e4d75a
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:45 571f075630fe4788af262d016999c625
msgid "图中需要记住四个位置："
msgstr "Remember these four areas:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:47 a1ddd92c77da4c7d81ad001af42c973a
msgid "`Open input structures`：导入初始结构。没有输入结构时，多数生成卡片没有可处理对象。"
msgstr ""
"`Open input structures`: import the starting structures. Most generation "
"cards have nothing to process until an input has been loaded."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:48 44c8469e746548e796f01d200ac33c0e
msgid "`Add new card`：添加构型生成或筛选卡片。"
msgstr "`Add new card`: add a structure-generation or filtering operation."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:49 263dab51af5847069307ae117e480bc8
msgid "`Run selected cards`：只运行已勾选的卡片。"
msgstr "`Run selected cards`: run only the cards that are currently selected."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:50 cf2cc034b2c2405c89f0a135320e1a01
msgid "`Workflow workspace`：卡片会按顺序放在这里，后续也在这里检查结果和导出。"
msgstr ""
"`Workflow workspace`: cards appear here in execution order; use the same "
"area to inspect and export their results."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:52 58404ba4028141beb06dfe618f260ddb
msgid "3. 生成一组候选结构"
msgstr "Step 3: Generate a candidate set"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:54 69bad9bc3feb412bb1fb174410082f75
msgid ""
"这里用 `Lattice Strain` 作为第一张卡。它的输入是已有结构，输出是一组晶格被拉伸或压缩后的结构。 "
"这一步得到的是候选结构，不是最终训练集。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Lattice Strain` as the first card. It takes existing structures and "
"produces variants with stretched or compressed cells. The output is a "
"candidate set, not a finished training set."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:57 d90928237fc54e1d8ae8e7d29e0352e4
msgid "先用 `Open` 导入初始结构。"
msgstr "Import a starting structure with `Open`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:58 777aef168a6c42b9b0ac9c2eb61a671b
msgid "点击 `Add new card`。"
msgstr "Click `Add new card`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:59 53a3b26809ec4f7794e8316d8638372f
msgid "选择 `Lattice Strain`。"
msgstr "Choose `Lattice Strain`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:60 35c4512413dd45dd9de4e8b08050e4fd
msgid "设置一个小范围，例如 X/Y/Z 都从 `-2%` 到 `2%`，步长 `1%`。"
msgstr ""
"Use a small initial range, for example `-2%` to `2%` along X, Y, and Z "
"with a `1%` step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:61 78098a30e8a5478591aec640d6346f88
msgid "勾选这张卡，点击顶部 `Run`。"
msgstr "Select the card and click `Run` in the title bar."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:62 faff077e692b478c95566ed3b102b908
msgid "运行完成后，从卡片上的导出按钮保存结果。"
msgstr "When the run finishes, save the result with the export button on the card."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:64 2912b2c4be9b4ae184c3f00a6f83a159
msgid "Lattice Strain quickstart"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:64 2912b2c4be9b4ae184c3f00a6f83a159
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/make_data_lattice_strain.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:69 b705ee6265db4a648768418b1b528bdb
msgid "这张图对应的使用逻辑是："
msgstr "The workflow illustrated above is deliberate:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:71 d71050c663c84593857f9a893117e5ff
msgid "先添加卡片，不要一开始就改很多高级参数。"
msgstr "Add the card first; do not begin by changing every advanced option."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:72 b9cc021b03f6452cbe6d96aeea3e1be7
msgid "只改与物理目标直接相关的范围，例如应变轴、最小值、最大值、步长。"
msgstr ""
"Change only the ranges tied directly to the physical objective, such as "
"the strain axes, minimum, maximum, and step."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:73 c1e1b39b9e4642bfab1f52383dc78013
msgid "运行后先看输出数量是否符合预期，再导出到下一步检查。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the output count is plausible before exporting the structures "
"for inspection."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:75 4eebba56a7f249ba88a25f047ba0faa5
msgid "4. 检查候选结构"
msgstr "Step 4: Inspect the candidates"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:77 f40b3ad6a47b44fd96284b2ddb1f06a2
msgid "`Make Dataset` 生成的是候选结构，不建议默认直接送 DFT。最短检查路径是："
msgstr ""
"`Make Dataset` produces candidates. Do not send them directly to DFT "
"without inspection. The shortest reliable path is:"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:79 55c85e317b8546eda68d8dc844e42245
msgid "NEP Dataset Display overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:79 55c85e317b8546eda68d8dc844e42245
msgid ".. image:: _static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:84 5c808580b3f7489caab67e2c397aabd0
msgid "在 `NEP Dataset Display` 打开候选结构。"
msgstr "Open the candidates in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:85 9eed536de2f6479a9a4528cfe5b1e5cd
msgid "先看结构和明显异常点。"
msgstr "Inspect the structures and the most obvious outliers first."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:86 f652979546a444ff9af180b280e2a135
msgid "删除或单独导出异常样本。"
msgstr "Delete problematic samples or export them separately for investigation."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:87 28e499cd78e3465da655d8a430e1dd18
msgid "清洗后再决定是否做 FPS 代表性采样。"
msgstr "After cleaning, decide whether representative FPS sampling is needed."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:89 4e1432a8830d4155a09024e5640d8e42
msgid "5. 进入 DFT 和训练"
msgstr "Step 5: Continue to DFT and training"

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:91 d899352f44a14818891f60b04f4e0fa6
msgid ""
"清洗后的结构再送去做第一性原理计算。DFT 标注完成后，用 GPUMD 训练 NEP； 训练结束后，再回到 `NEP Dataset "
"Display` 查看训练误差。"
msgstr ""
"Send the cleaned structures to first-principles calculations. Once DFT "
"labels are available, train the NEP model with GPUMD. Return to `NEP "
"Dataset Display` after training to inspect the errors."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:94 599e8e1142914a109cf10de147b33c72
msgid ""
"完整的清洗顺序、为什么不要先 FPS、以及如何用 NEP 预测做预筛，见 [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](workflows/clean-"
"candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete order of operations, why FPS should not "
"come first, and how to use NEP predictions for prescreening."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:97 c56e3a3cc853433e90c3384528c9a0ae
msgid ""
"如果你在做缺陷、表面、掺杂或磁性结构，直接去看 [Make Dataset 卡片手册](module/make-dataset-"
"cards/index.md)。手册按卡片用途组织，比逐个试菜单更快。"
msgstr ""
"For defects, surfaces, doping, or magnetic configurations, go directly to"
" the [Make Dataset card manual](module/make-dataset-cards/index.md). It "
"is organized by physical objective, which is faster than trying cards one"
" by one."

#: ../../source/quickstart.md:99 66c28a60adba4b84a7a30ed670aad652
msgid ""
"如果你要从标准晶体开始，而不是导入已有结构，可以先用 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 生成 "
"`fcc`、`bcc`、`hcp` 或 `fcc111` 原型。需要扫 fcc (111) 的 GSFE 路径时，先生成 `fcc111` "
"原型，再接 `Strict GSFE Path`；不要把普通 cubic `fcc` cell 直接拿去扫 `(111)`。"
msgstr ""
"To start from a standard crystal instead of importing an existing "
"structure, use `Crystal Prototype Builder` to create an `fcc`, `bcc`, "
"`hcp`, or `fcc111` prototype. For an fcc (111) GSFE scan, create `fcc111`"
" first and feed it into `Strict GSFE Path`; do not use a conventional "
"cubic `fcc` cell directly for a `(111)` scan."
